{"sectionId":"solid/crystal","items":[{"id":"solid--crystal-k001","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"결정성 고체는 장거리 규칙 배열을 가지며 비결정성 고체는 그러한 장거리 질서가 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k002","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"이온 결정은 정전기적 상호작용, 금속은 비편재 전자 결합, 공유결합 망상 고체는 연속 공유결합, 분자 결정은 분자 간 힘으로 결합한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k003","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"단순입방(SC)은 단위세포당 원자 1개·배위수 6, 체심입방(BCC)은 2개·배위수 8, 면심입방(FCC)은 4개·배위수 12이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k004","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"HCP도 배위수 12의 조밀 충전이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k005","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"SC에서 a=2r, BCC에서 √3a=4r, FCC에서 √2a=4r이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k006","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"충전율은 각각 약 52%,68%,74%이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k007","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"결정 밀도 ρ=ZM/(Nₐa³)이며 a를 cm 단위로 바꾸면 g/cm³를 얻는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k008","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"Bragg 법칙 nλ=2d sinθ는 X선 회절 조건을 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k009","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"NaCl형 구조는 양이온·음이온 배위수 6, CsCl형은 8, zinc blende형은 4가 대표적이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k010","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"꼭짓점 원자는 1/8, 모서리는 1/4, 면 중심은 1/2, 몸체 중심은 1개 기여.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k011","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"FCC와 HCP는 충전율이 같다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k012","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"CsCl형 구조를 단원자 BCC와 동일시하면 안 된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k013","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"격자에너지의 부호는 형성 또는 분리 정의를 확인한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"solid--crystal-k014","sectionId":"solid/crystal","unitId":"solid","subject":"chemistry","text":"8×1/8+6×1/2=4개이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}